 OpenClaw.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><div class=\"border-border border-b border-t\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><button class=\"group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left sm:py-8\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"font-medium text-base text-foreground transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg\">How do I install a pack?</span><div class=\"mt-1 shrink-0\" style=\"transform: rotate(180deg);\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground sm:h-6 sm:w-6\"><path d=\"M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg></div></button><div class=\"overflow-hidden\" style=\"height:auto;opacity:1\"><div class=\"pr-8 pb-6 sm:pb-8\"><p class=\"text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed sm:text-base\">Download the pack, unzip into your OpenClaw workspace, and start the gateway. Each pack includes SOUL.md and agent files. If OpenClaw is already set up, the fastest option is to drop the zip into your bot and ask it to set up the team.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"border-border border-b \" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><button class=\"group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left sm:py-8\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"font-medium text-base text-foreground transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg\">Can I customize agents?</span><div class=\"mt-1 shrink-0\" style=\"transform: none;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground sm:h-6 sm:w-6\"><path d=\"M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-border border-b \" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><button class=\"group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left sm:py-8\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"font-medium text-base text-foreground transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg\">Does Pro include updates?</span><div class=\"mt-1 shrink-0\" style=\"transform: none;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground sm:h-6 sm:w-6\"><path d=\"M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-border border-b \" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><button class=\"group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left sm:py-8\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"font-medium text-base text-foreground transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg\">How can I verify packs are safe?</span><div class=\"mt-1 shrink-0\" style=\"transform: none;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground sm:h-6 sm:w-6\"><path d=\"M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-border border-b \" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><button class=\"group flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-4 py-6 text-left sm:py-8\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"font-medium text-base text-foreground transition-colors duration-200 group-hover:text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg\">Do I get support?</span><div class=\"mt-1 shrink-0\" style=\"transform: none;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" class=\"h-5 w-5 text-muted-foreground sm:h-6 sm: