interface.\r\n\r\n1. Architectural role inside LEGAiSEE\r\nYou now have 3 layers in your system:\r\n\r\nA. shell.php\r\n→ “Grand Lobby”\r\n\r\nentry point\r\n\r\nmodule orchestration hub\r\n\r\nsystem-wide navigation surface\r\n\r\nB. search_workspace.php (THIS FILE)\r\n→ Analysis Workbench Layer\r\n\r\nstructured reasoning environment\r\n\r\nartifact comparison engine\r\n\r\nearly-stage intelligence synthesis UI\r\n\r\nC. Modules (search_module.php, graph_module.php, etc.)\r\n→ raw computation + data engines\r\n\r\n2. What you LAST built (most accurate answer)\r\nFrom this file specifically, the last real build milestone is:\r\n\r\n✔ Search Workspace V1 (Dual Artifact System)\r\nYou successfully implemented:\r\n\r\n1. Dual-pane intelligence architecture\r\nArtifact A (historical / internal signal)\r\n\r\nArtifact B (comparative / external signal)\r\n\r\nThis is important because it introduces:\r\n\r\ncomparative reasoning as a UI primitive\r\n\r\n2. Structured intelligence blocks\r\nYou didn’t just render content — you structured cognition:\r\n\r\nAuthority Sequence analysis\r\n\r\nComparative Signal drift detection\r\n\r\nRelationship overlap analysis\r\n\r\nThis is effectively:\r\n\r\nearly-stage “AI reasoning scaffolding UI”\r\n\r\n3. Module integration point\r\n<?= renderModule(\'search\'); ?>\r\nThis tells me:\r\n\r\nSearch engine logic is externalized\r\n\r\nWorkspace is a presentation + reasoning layer\r\n\r\nYou are separating:\r\n\r\ncomputation (module)\r\n\r\ninterpretation (workspace)\r\n\r\nThat’s correct architecture.\r\n\r\n4. Side-rail intelligence system\r\nYou built a second cognitive layer:\r\n\r\nAI Observation Rail\r\n\r\nNetwork Intelligence panel\r\n\r\nSignal recommendations\r\n\r\nThis is important:\r\n\r\nYou are starting to model “AI commentary as a parallel system stream”\r\n\r\nNot just output — interpretation layer.\r\n\r\n3. What this means in system evolution\r\nYou have now crossed a major threshold:\r\n\r\nYou are no longer building a dashboard system.\r\nYou are building:\r\n\r\nA multi-layer intelligence reasoning environment (proto-operating system for analysis)\r\n\r\nSpecifically:\r\n\r\nLayer 1: Shell (navigation + module runtime)\r\nLayer 2: Workspace (reasoning + comparison UI)\r\nLayer 3: Modules (data + computation engines)\r\n4. The REAL last thing you built (in one sentence)\r\nIf I compress it:\r\n\r\nYou built a functioning Search Workspace V1 dual-artifact intelligence comparison engine with side-rail analytical inference layer and modular search injection point.\r\n\r\n5. The important technical implication (this is key)\r\nYour current system now has a hidden problem:\r\n\r\nYou are duplicating “intelligence rendering logic” across:\r\nshell.php (exec-panel rendering)\r\n\r\nsearch_workspace.php (structured reasoning rendering)\r\n\r\nfuture modules (likely different formats again)\r\n\r\nThis will eventually cause:\r\n\r\nformat fragmentation across your entire command center\r\n\r\n6. What you should build next (not optional if you continue correctly)\r\nYou are now at the point where the system needs:\r\n\r\n👉 “Unified Intelligence Output Contract (UIOC)”\r\nMeaning:\r\n\r\nAll modules must output:\r\n\r\neither array\r\n\r\nor standard object schema\r\n\r\nor raw string\r\n\r\nAND ALL UI layers must render it the same way.\r\n\r\nBottom line\r\nLast thing you built:\r\nA fully functional Search Workspace V1 dual-artifact intelligence reasoning environment\r\n\r\nWhat it proves:\r\nyour system now supports structured cognition UI\r\n\r\nnot just data display\r\n\r\nbut comparative reasoning + inference visualization\r\n\r\nIf you want the next correct step, I can map:\r\n\r\n→ exactly how Search Workspace, Shell, and Modules should standardize output\r\nso you stop getting:\r\n\r\ninconsistent rendering\r\n\r\nfunction collisions\r\n\r\nmismatched UI behaviors\r\n\r\nThat’s the next architectural unlock in LEGAiSEE.\r\n\r\n\r\nyes, as of now search and intel workspaves are mockups, they dont have data connected yet\r\n\r\nGood — that clarification actually tightens the architecture a lot.\r\n\r\nRight now you are in a very specific phase:\r\n\r\nUI/UX “cognitive shell layer” is built, but the data + intelligence substrate is not connected yet\r\n\r\nSo what you currently have is:\r\n\r\n✔ Shell (real module loader + layout system)\r\n\r\n✔ Search Workspace V1 (reasoning UI mock)\r\n\r\n✔ Intelligence concepts (structured UI thinking)\r\n\r\n❌ No live data pipeline\r\n\r\n❌ No unified module output contract\r\n\r\n❌ No true “search → ingest → reason → render” loop\r\n\r\nThat’s actually a clean separation point. Now we can formalize it properly.\r\n\r\n1. Your REAL current architecture (honest state)\r\nLayer 1 — Presentation Layer (DONE)\r\nThese are what you already built:\r\n\r\nshell.php → Command Center UI runtime\r\n\r\nsearch_workspace.php → Comparative reasoning UI mock\r\n\r\nfuture intelligence_workspace.php → same category\r\n\r\n⚠️ Important: these are static cognitive interfaces right now\r\n\r\nLayer 2 — Module Layer (PARTIAL)\r\nYou have:\r\n\r\nrenderModule() loader (good foundation)\r\n\r\n*_module.php files (exist, but inconsistent maturity)\r\n\r\nno strict interface contract\r\n\r\nLayer 3 — Data / Intelligence Layer (MISSING)\r\nThis is what does NOT exist yet:\r\n\r\nNo unified search engine output schema\r\n\r\nNo ingestion pipeline feeding modules\r\n\r\nNo graph memory store\r\n\r\nNo canonical “artifact format”\r\n\r\n2. The core problem you are about to hit\r\nRight now every workspace is independently imagining data:\r\n\r\nSearch workspace pretends “Artifact A/B exists”\r\n\r\nShell assumes modules return arrays or strings\r\n\r\nModules likely return mixed formats\r\n\r\nThis leads to a critical failure mode:\r\n“Each UI invents its own reality of the data layer”\r\n\r\nThat will eventually break:\r\n\r\nconsistency\r\n\r\ngraph building\r\n\r\nintelligence comparisons\r\n\r\ncross-module reasoning\r\n\r\n3. The missing piece (this is the real next build)\r\nYou do NOT need more UI.\r\n\r\nYou need this:\r\n\r\n👉 LEGAiSEE Unified Intelligence Contract (UIC V1)\r\nThis is the bridge between:\r\n\r\nmodules → workspaces → reasoning layer\r\n\r\n4. What UIC V1 defines (simple but strict)\r\nEvery module must return ONE of these:\r\n\r\nOption A: Structured Artifact\r\n[\r\n  \"type\" => \"artifact\",\r\n  \"title\" => \"...\",\r\n  \"summary\" => \"...\",\r\n  \"signals\" => [],\r\n  \"entities\" => [],\r\n  \"timestamp\" => \"...\",\r\n  \"confidence\" => 0.0\r\n]\r\nOption B: Dataset Response\r\n[\r\n  \"type\" => \"dataset\",\r\n  \"records\" => [],\r\n  \"meta\" => [\r\n      \"count\" => 0,\r\n      \"source\" => \"search|ingest|graph\"\r\n  ]\r\n]\r\nOption C: System Message\r\n[\r\n  \"type\" => \"system\",\r\n  \"message\" => \"...\"\r\n]\r\n5. Then your renderer becomes deterministic\r\nRight now:\r\n\r\nrenderModule()\r\ntries to guess output.\r\n\r\nYou want to change that to:\r\n\r\nNEW RULE: “No guessing allowed”\r\nRender behavior becomes:\r\n\r\nartifact → structured card UI\r\n\r\ndataset → table/list UI\r\n\r\nsystem → status line\r\n\r\nerror → error block\r\n\r\n6. How this fixes Search Workspace immediately\r\nYour current mock:\r\n\r\nArtifact A / B panels\r\nare just visual placeholders\r\n\r\nOnce UIC exists:\r\n\r\nArtifact A = real module output\r\nArtifact B = real comparative module output\r\nThen your UI stops being “storytelling” and becomes:\r\n\r\nlive comparative intelligence computation interface\r\n\r\n7. The actual correct next build order\r\nNot optional if you want LEGAiSEE to become real:\r\n\r\nSTEP 1 (CRITICAL FOUNDATION)\r\nBuild: uic_contract.php\r\ndefines standard output schema\r\n\r\nshared by ALL modules\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nRefactor:\r\nsearch_module.php\r\n\r\nintelligence_dashboard_module.php\r\n\r\ngraph_module.php\r\n\r\nso they ALL return UIC objects\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nUpgrade renderer:\r\nshell.php renderModule()\r\n\r\nsearch_workspace.php renderModule()\r\n\r\nto be UIC-aware\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\nTHEN (only then)\r\nConnect:\r\n\r\nsearch engine\r\n\r\ningest system\r\n\r\ngraph system\r\n\r\n8. Key insight (important)\r\nRight now you are building UI that pretends intelligence exists.\r\n\r\nThe next phase is:\r\n\r\nmaking intelligence real enough that the UI becomes truthful instead of illustrative\r\n\r\nBottom line\r\nYou are at the transition point between:\r\n\r\n❌ “Intelligence-themed UI system”\r\nand\r\n\r\n✅ “Actual modular intelligence operating system”\r\nIf you want, I can build your next file exactly:\r\n\r\nuic_contract.php (drop-in foundation layer)\r\nThat becomes the backbone that:\r\n\r\neliminates module chaos\r\n\r\nstops rendering inconsistencies\r\n\r\nprepares Search + Intelligence Workspace for real data\r\n\r\nJust say the word and I’ll construct it in full production-ready form.\r\n\r\n\r\n<?php\r\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\r\n\r\nerror_reporting(E_ALL);\r\nini_set(\'display_errors\', \'1\');\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* SYSTEM BOOT */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\nif (file_exists(__DIR__ . \'/kernel/kernel_boot.php\')) {\r\n    require_once __DIR__ . \'/kernel/kernel_boot.php\';\r\n}\r\n\r\nif (file_exists(__DIR__ . \'/modules/utils/bootstrap.php\')) {\r\n    require_once __DIR__ . \'/modules/utils/bootstrap.php\';\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* ACTIVE MODULE */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n$activeModule = $_GET[\'module\'] ?? \'intelligence_dashboard\';\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* SAFE MODULE LOADER */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\nfunction renderModule(string $module): string\r\n{\r\n    $file = __DIR__ . \"/modules/{$module}_module.php\";\r\n\r\n    if (!file_exists($file)) {\r\n        return \"<div class=\'system-message\'>Module not found</div>\";\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    try {\r\n\r\n        ob_start();\r\n\r\n        $result = require $file;\r\n\r\n        $buffer = trim(ob_get_clean());\r\n\r\n        if (!empty($buffer)) {\r\n            return \"\r\n            <div class=\'module-output\'>\r\n                {$buffer}\r\n            </div>\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        if (is_array($result)) {\r\n\r\n            return \"\r\n            <pre class=\'json-output\'>\" .\r\n                htmlspecialchars(\r\n                    json_encode(\r\n                        $result,\r\n                        JSON_PRETTY_PRINT | JSON_UNESCAPED_SLASHES\r\n                    )\r\n                ) .\r\n            \"</pre>\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        if (is_string($result)) {\r\n\r\n            return \"\r\n            <div class=\'module-output\'>\r\n                {$result}\r\n            </div>\";\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        return \"<div class=\'system-message\'>Workspace Active</div>\";\r\n\r\n    } catch (Throwable $e) {\r\n\r\n        return \"\r\n        <div class=\'system-error\'>\r\n            \" . htmlspecialchars($e->getMessage()) . \"\r\n        </div>\";\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n?>\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n\r\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n\r\n<title>LEGAiSEE Intelligence Workspace</title>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* RESET */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n*{\r\n    margin:0;\r\n    padding:0;\r\n    box-sizing:border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* ROOT */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n:root{\r\n\r\n    --bg-1:#070706;\r\n    --bg-2:#0B0B0D;\r\n    --bg-3:#181619;\r\n    --bg-4:#181B22;\r\n    --bg-5:#272A31;\r\n\r\n    --gold-1:#89612B;\r\n    --gold-2:#A76B09;\r\n    --gold-3:#AC8B56;\r\n    --gold-4:#CDAD69;\r\n    --gold-5:#DDA74F;\r\n    --gold-6:#F4E185;\r\n\r\n    --gold-gradient:\r\n        linear-gradient(\r\n            135deg,\r\n            #e6c256,\r\n            #ce9008,\r\n            #e7ca5d,\r\n            #AC8B56,\r\n            #CDAD69,\r\n            #DDA74F\r\n        );\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* BODY */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\nbody{\r\n\r\n    font-family:\r\n        Inter,\r\n        system-ui,\r\n        sans-serif;\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n        url(\'/commandcenter/ui/images/dark-room-with-black-wall-black-wall-with-carved-design_902639-63079-upscale-4x.jpg\')\r\n        center center / cover no-repeat fixed;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-4);\r\n\r\n    min-height:100vh;\r\n\r\n    overflow-x:hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\nbody::before{\r\n\r\n    content:\"\";\r\n\r\n    position:fixed;\r\n    inset:0;\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n        radial-gradient(\r\n            circle at top center,\r\n            rgba(244,225,133,0.08),\r\n            rgba(0,0,0,0.85)\r\n        );\r\n\r\n    pointer-events:none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* SCROLLBAR */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n*::-webkit-scrollbar{\r\n    width:5px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n*::-webkit-scrollbar-track{\r\n    background:transparent;\r\n}\r\n\r\n*::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{\r\n\r\n    border-radius:20px;\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n        linear-gradient(\r\n            180deg,\r\n            #e6c256,\r\n            #ce9008,\r\n            #CDAD69\r\n        );\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* NAVBAR */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.topbar{\r\n\r\n    position:sticky;\r\n    top:0;\r\n\r\n    z-index:999;\r\n\r\n    height:84px;\r\n\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:space-between;\r\n\r\n    padding:0 34px;\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n        rgba(8,8,10,0.58);\r\n\r\n    backdrop-filter:blur(20px);\r\n\r\n    border-bottom:\r\n        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\r\n\r\n    box-shadow:\r\n        0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* LOGO */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.logo-wrap{\r\n\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.logo-wrap img{\r\n\r\n    height:42px;\r\n\r\n    object-fit:contain;\r\n\r\n    filter:\r\n        drop-shadow(0 0 14px rgba(244,225,133,0.08));\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* NAV */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.nav{\r\n\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    gap:14px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.nav a{\r\n\r\n    text-decoration:none;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-4);\r\n\r\n    font-size:11px;\r\n\r\n    letter-spacing:2px;\r\n\r\n    text-transform:uppercase;\r\n\r\n    padding:11px 16px;\r\n\r\n    border-radius:14px;\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n        rgba(255,255,255,0.02);\r\n\r\n    border:\r\n        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\r\n\r\n    transition:\r\n        all 0.25s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.nav a:hover{\r\n\r\n    transform:\r\n        translateY(-2px);\r\n\r\n    border-color:\r\n        rgba(255,220,120,0.18);\r\n\r\n    color:\r\n        #fff6cd;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* COMMAND FLOOR */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.command-floor{\r\n\r\n    width:100%;\r\n\r\n    max-width:1800px;\r\n\r\n    margin:auto;\r\n\r\n    padding:42px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* EXEC SURFACE */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.executive-surface{\r\n\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    padding:42px;\r\n\r\n    border-radius:34px;\r\n\r\n    overflow:hidden;\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n        linear-gradient(\r\n            180deg,\r\n            rgba(22,22,26,0.76),\r\n            rgba(10,10,12,0.94)\r\n        );\r\n\r\n    backdrop-filter:blur(18px);\r\n\r\n    border:\r\n        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\r\n\r\n    box-shadow:\r\n        0 40px 120px rgba(0,0,0,0.72),\r\n        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* HEADER */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.workspace-header{\r\n\r\n    margin-bottom:42px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.workspace-label{\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-2);\r\n\r\n    font-size:11px;\r\n\r\n    letter-spacing:4px;\r\n\r\n    text-transform:uppercase;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.workspace-title{\r\n\r\n    margin-top:16px;\r\n\r\n    font-size:40px;\r\n\r\n    font-weight:300;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-6);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.workspace-sub{\r\n\r\n    margin-top:18px;\r\n\r\n    max-width:860px;\r\n\r\n    line-height:1.9;\r\n\r\n    font-size:14px;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* SNAPSHOT STRIP */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.snapshot-strip{\r\n\r\n    display:grid;\r\n\r\n    grid-template-columns:\r\n        repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));\r\n\r\n    gap:22px;\r\n\r\n    margin-bottom:44px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* SNAPSHOT */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.snapshot{\r\n\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    padding:26px;\r\n\r\n    border-radius:22px;\r\n\r\n    overflow:hidden;\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n        linear-gradient(\r\n            180deg,\r\n            rgba(255,255,255,0.03),\r\n            rgba(255,255,255,0.01)\r\n        );\r\n\r\n    border:\r\n        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\r\n\r\n    box-shadow:\r\n        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.snapshot-label{\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-2);\r\n\r\n    font-size:10px;\r\n\r\n    letter-spacing:3px;\r\n\r\n    text-transform:uppercase;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.snapshot-value{\r\n\r\n    margin-top:16px;\r\n\r\n    font-size:34px;\r\n\r\n    font-weight:200;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-6);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.snapshot-sub{\r\n\r\n    margin-top:10px;\r\n\r\n    font-size:13px;\r\n\r\n    line-height:1.7;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-3);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* MAIN GRID */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.intelligence-grid{\r\n\r\n    display:grid;\r\n\r\n    grid-template-columns:\r\n        minmax(0,2fr)\r\n        minmax(340px,0.9fr);\r\n\r\n    gap:28px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* PANELS */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.panel{\r\n\r\n    position:relative;\r\n\r\n    border-radius:28px;\r\n\r\n    overflow:hidden;\r\n\r\n    background:\r\n        linear-gradient(\r\n            180deg,\r\n            rgba(18,18,22,0.95),\r\n            rgba(10,10,12,0.98)\r\n        );\r\n\r\n    border:\r\n        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\r\n\r\n    padding:28px;\r\n\r\n    box-shadow:\r\n        inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* PANEL HEADER */\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n\r\n.panel-header{\r\n\r\n    display:flex;\r\n    align-items:center;\r\n    justify-content:space-between;\r\n\r\n    margin-bottom:26px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.panel-title{\r\n\r\n    font-size:22px;\r\n\r\n    font-weight:300;\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-6);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.panel-label{\r\n\r\n    color:var(--gold-2);\r\n\r\n    font-size:10px;\r\n\r\n    letter-spacing:3px;\r\n\r\n    text-transform:uppercase;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* ===================================================== */\r\n/* TIMELINE */\r\