ty	Text\r\nIndustry	Select\r\nStatus	Select\r\nPhase	Select\r\nDate Started	Date\r\nData Collected	Checkbox\r\nAI Extracted	Checkbox\r\nReport Done	Checkbox\r\nPriority	Select\r\nNotes	Text\r\nSTEP 4 — Configure Dropdown Values\r\nStatus:\r\nLead\r\n\r\nShallow Dig\r\n\r\nContacted\r\n\r\nFull Dig\r\n\r\nCompleted\r\n\r\nPhase:\r\nCollection\r\n\r\nExtraction\r\n\r\nStructuring\r\n\r\nDone\r\n\r\nPriority:\r\nHigh\r\n\r\nMedium\r\n\r\nLow\r\n\r\nSTEP 5 — Create Case Template\r\nClick “New” → “+ New Template”\r\n\r\nName:\r\n\r\nSTANDARD DIG TEMPLATE\r\nSTEP 6 — Paste This Inside Template\r\n# BUSINESS OVERVIEW\r\n\r\nName:\r\nCity:\r\nIndustry:\r\nWebsite:\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# RAW DATA\r\n\r\n## Website History\r\n(Paste Wayback data)\r\n\r\n## Reviews\r\n(Paste Google/Yelp)\r\n\r\n## Social\r\n(Paste Facebook/Instagram)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# AI EXTRACTION\r\n\r\n(Paste Claude/ChatGPT output)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# FINAL REPORT\r\n\r\n(Paste final structured report)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# INSIGHTS\r\n\r\n- Key Opportunity:\r\n- Major Issue:\r\n- Revenue Gap:\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# STATUS CHECKLIST\r\n\r\n[ ] Data Collected  \r\n[ ] AI Extracted  \r\n[ ] Report Completed  \r\nSTEP 7 — Create Views (IMPORTANT)\r\nView 1 — Pipeline\r\nClick “+ Add View”\r\n\r\nSelect Board\r\n\r\nGroup by: Status\r\n\r\nView 2 — Daily Work\r\nTable view\r\n\r\nFilter:\r\n\r\nStatus = Shallow Dig\r\n\r\nView 3 — Full Dig Clients\r\nFilter:\r\n\r\nStatus = Full Dig\r\n\r\n🧠 PART 2 — SERVER UI STRUCTURE (FOR YOUR SYSTEM)\r\nYou already have backend logic—this is how to structure UI so it aligns with your workflow.\r\n\r\nCORE UI PANELS\r\nPANEL 1 — CASE DASHBOARD\r\nFields:\r\n\r\nBusiness Name\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n\r\nIndustry\r\n\r\nStatus dropdown\r\n\r\nPhase dropdown\r\n\r\nButtons:\r\n\r\n“Start Shallow Dig”\r\n\r\n“Start Full Dig”\r\n\r\nPANEL 2 — DATA INGEST\r\nSections:\r\n\r\nWebsite History (textarea)\r\n\r\nReviews (textarea)\r\n\r\nSocial (textarea)\r\n\r\nButton:\r\n\r\nSAVE RAW DATA\r\nP