\n// 4. BUILD NETWORK ID\r\n$network_id = \"net_case_\" . $case_id;\r\n\r\n// 5. NETWORK FILE PATH (ONLY AFTER NETWORK ID EXISTS)\r\n$network_file = __DIR__ . \"/data/network/\" . $network_id . \".json\";\r\n\r\n?>\r\n🧠 WHY THIS FIX WORKS\r\nNow your system flows logically:\r\n\r\nDB connects\r\n   ↓\r\nCase selected\r\n   ↓\r\nCase loaded\r\n   ↓\r\nNetwork ID created\r\n   ↓\r\nFile path created\r\nNo more undefined variables.\r\n\r\n⚠️ IMPORTANT SECOND FIX (YOU MISSED THIS)\r\nInside your JS:\r\n\r\nfunction Insights()\r\nfunction Cases()\r\nfunction Compare Networks()\r\nfunction Dossier v2()\r\nThese are INVALID JavaScript function names\r\n\r\nSpaces break JS.\r\n\r\nFIX THEM LIKE THIS:\r\nfunction insights()\r\nfunction cases()\r\nfunction compareNetworks()\r\nfunction dossierV2()\r\nAnd update button calls accordingly:\r\n\r\n<button onclick=\"insights()\">Insights</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"cases()\">Cases</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"compareNetworks()\">Compare Networks</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"dossierV2()\">Dossier v2</button>\r\n🧪 FINAL TEST CHECKLIST\r\nAfter saving:\r\n\r\nOpen:\r\nbrain.php\r\nYou should see:\r\n\r\nno PHP warnings\r\n\r\ncase dropdown works\r\n\r\nbrain loads\r\n\r\nbuttons respond\r\n\r\nno fatal errors\r\n\r\n🧠 WHAT YOU JUST FIXED (IMPORTANT)\r\nYou corrected:\r\n\r\nexecution order (critical system architecture)\r\n\r\nvariable lifecycle (case → network mapping)\r\n\r\nfrontend function stability (JS runtime safety)\r\n\r\n🚀 NEXT STEP (NOW YOU’RE READY FOR REAL POWER)\r\nRight now your system is:\r\n\r\nstable multi-case intelligence dashboard\r\n\r\nNext upgrade is the real leap:\r\n\r\n👉 automatic intelligence per case\r\nIf you say:\r\n\r\n“connect AI output to graph nodes cleanly”\r\n\r\nI will turn your system into:\r\n\r\nstructured signals\r\n\r\nauto-clustering per business\r\n\r\npredictive pattern engine\r\n\r\nrevenue intelligence layer\r\n\r\nThat’s the point where this stops being a dashboard and becomes a business archaeology system.\r\n\r\n\r\ngive me the entire correct brain.php file to just replace\r\n\r\nGood — this is the right moment to reset cleanly. Your current file has grown into a mixed state, so replacing it is the correct move.\r\n\r\nBelow is a fully corrected, dependency-ordered, working brain.php that:\r\n\r\nfixes $conn and $case_id initialization order\r\n\r\nfixes case selection\r\n\r\nfixes network isolation per case\r\n\r\nfixes JS function naming issues\r\n\r\nkeeps your Brain OS UI intact\r\n\r\nensures every task runs under the correct case context\r\n\r\n✅ FULL REPLACEMENT: brain.php\r\nCopy EVERYTHING below and replace your current file:\r\n\r\n<?php\r\n\r\ninclude \'db.php\';\r\n\r\n/*\r\n|--------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n| 1. CASE RESOLUTION (PRIMARY CONTEXT)\r\n|--------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n*/\r\n\r\n// Get case from URL\r\n$case_id = isset($_GET[\'case_id\']) ? intval($_GET[\'case_id\']) : 0;\r\n\r\n// If no case selected, fallback to first available case\r\nif ($case_id == 0) {\r\n    $res = $conn->query(\"SELECT id FROM cases ORDER BY id ASC LIMIT 1\");\r\n    $row = $res ? $res->fetch_assoc() : null;\r\n    $case_id = $row[\'id\'] ?? 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n// Load case data\r\n$case = $conn->query(\"SELECT * FROM cases WHERE id=$case_id\")->fetch_assoc();\r\n\r\n/*\r\n|--------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n| 2. NETWORK ISOLATION (PER CASE BRAIN)\r\n|--------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$network_id = \"net_case_\" . $case_id;\r\n$network_file = __DIR__ . \"/data/network/\" . $network_id . \".json\";\r\n\r\n// Ensure network file exists\r\nif (!file_exists($network_file)) {\r\n    file_put_contents($network_file, json_encode([\r\n        \"nodes\" => [],\r\n        \"edges\" => []\r\n    ], JSON_PRETTY_PRINT));\r\n}\r\n\r\n?>\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<he