\" => \"build_graph_reached\"\r\n]);\r\n\r\nexit;\r\n🧪 STEP 2 — TEST\r\nClick:\r\n\r\nBuild Relationships\r\n✅ EXPECTED RESULT\r\n{\r\n  \"status\": \"build_graph_reached\"\r\n}\r\n❌ IF IT STILL FREEZES\r\nThen the problem is NOT the file logic\r\n\r\nIt is one of these:\r\n\r\n🔴 POSSIBILITY A — WRONG FILE PATH\r\nYour button calls:\r\n\r\napi(\"api/v8/build_graph.php\", \"POST\", ...)\r\nBut your real file might be somewhere else like:\r\n\r\n/api/build_graph.php\r\n/api/v7/build_graph.php\r\n🔴 POSSIBILITY B — .htaccess / routing issue\r\nRequest never reaches file → hangs\r\n\r\n🔴 POSSIBILITY C — PHP fatal crash before output\r\n🧱 STEP 3 — VERIFY FILE IS ACTUALLY HIT\r\nModify file again:\r\n\r\n<?php\r\n\r\nfile_put_contents(\"debug_log.txt\", \"build_graph HIT\\n\", FILE_APPEND);\r\n\r\nheader(\'Content-Type: application/json\');\r\n\r\necho json_encode([\"status\"=>\"hit\"]);\r\nexit;\r\nTHEN:\r\nClick button again\r\n\r\nCHECK:\r\n/commandcenter/api/v8/debug_log.txt\r\nRESULTS:\r\n✅ If file updates\r\n→ request is reaching file → something inside was hanging\r\n\r\n❌ If file NOT created\r\n→ request is NOT hitting this file → wrong path\r\n\r\n🧠 MOST LIKELY REALITY (BASED ON YOUR SYMPTOMS)\r\nSince:\r\n\r\ningest works\r\n\r\nother endpoints return invalid JSON\r\n\r\nonly this one freezes\r\n\r\n👉 This file still contains heavy logic (probably nested loops or file reads)\r\n\r\n🚨 TEMPORARY STABILIZATION RULE\r\nUntil system is stable:\r\n\r\n❗ NO loops\r\n❗ NO graph building\r\n❗ NO node comparisons\r\n\r\n🧱 STEP 4 — LOCK SAFE VERSION\r\nOnce confirmed working, keep it as:\r\n\r\n<?php\r\n\r\nheader(\'Content-Type: application/json\');\r\n\r\necho json_encode([\r\n    \"status\" => \"graph_stubbed_safe\"\r\n]);\r\n\r\nexit;\r\n🧠 WHY THIS MATTERS\r\nRight now you\'re doing:\r\n\r\nBuild system + debug + run heavy logic simultaneously ❌\r\nWe need:\r\n\r\nStabilize endpoints → THEN add logic safely ✅\r\n🚀 WHERE YOU ARE\r\nYou have:\r\n\r\nUI ✅\r\nIngest ✅\r\nAPI routing (mostly) ✅\r\nOne endpoint unstable ❗\r\n👉 NEXT STEP\r\nTell me:\r\n\r\nDoes the minimal test version return JSON OR still freeze?\r\n\r\nThat answer determines:\r\n\r\nwhether we fix routing\r\n\r\nor fix logic\r\n\r\nNo guessing from here—we isolate it cleanly.\r\n\r\n\r\ni dont habe build graph button = <?php\r\nrequire_once \'db.php\';\r\n\r\n// GET CASE\r\n$case_id = isset($_GET[\'case_id\']) ? intval($_GET[\'case_id\']) : 0;\r\n\r\nif ($case_id == 0) {\r\n    $res = $conn->query(\"SELECT id FROM cases ORDER BY id ASC LIMIT 1\");\r\n    if ($row = $res->fetch_assoc()) {\r\n        $case_id = $row[\'id\'];\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n$case = $conn->query(\"SELECT * FROM cases WHERE id=$case_id\")->fetch_assoc();\r\n$network_id = \"net_case_\" . $case_id;\r\n?>\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n<title>LEGAISEE Brain OS</title>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\nbody { background:#0a0a0f; color:#FFD700; font-family:Segoe UI; padding:20px; }\r\nbutton { padding:8px 12px; margin:4px; background:#FFD700; border:none; cursor:pointer; }\r\ntextarea { width:100%; height:80px; margin-top:10px; }\r\n.box { border:1px solid rgba(255,215,0,0.3); padding:10px; margin-top:10px; }\r\n.status { font-size:12px; color:#aaa; margin-top:5px; }\r\n.section { margin-top:20px; }\r\n</style>\r\n</head>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<h2>🧠 LEGAISEE Brain OS</h2>\r\n\r\n<!-- CASE SELECT -->\r\n<form method=\"GET\">\r\n<select name=\"case_id\" onchange=\"this.form.submit()\">\r\n<?php\r\n$res = $conn->query(\"SELECT * FROM cases ORDER BY id DESC\");\r\nwhile($row = $res->fetch_assoc()){\r\n    $selected = ($row[\'id\'] == $case_id) ? \"selected\" : \"\";\r\n    echo \"<option value=\'{$row[\'id\']}\' $selected>\r\n        {$row[\'business_name\']} ({$row[\'city\']})\r\n    </option>\";\r\n}\r\n?>\r\n</select>\r\n</form>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"box\">\r\n<b>Active Case:</b> <?= $case[\'business_name\'] ?? \'None\'; ?>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- INPUT -->\r\n<textarea id=\"input\" placeholder=\"Enter intelligence...\"></textarea>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section\">\r\n<b>Core</b><br>\r\n<button onclick=\"ingest()\">Ingest</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"buildGraph()\">Build Relationships</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"clusters()\">Clusters</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"insights()\">Insights</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"recommendations()\">Recommendations</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"generateTasks()\">Generate Tasks</button>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section\">\r\n<b>Execution</b><br>\r\n<button onclick=\"runWorker()\">Run Worker</button>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"section\">\r\n<b>Debug</b><br>\r\n<button onclick=\"checkTasks()\">View Tasks</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"checkQueue()\">View Queue</button>\r\n<button onclick=\"loadNetwork()\">View Network JSON</button>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"box\" id=\"output\">Output...</div>\r\n<div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">Ready</div>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nconst CASE_ID = \"<?= $case_id ?>\";\r\n\r\n// UNIVERSAL FETCH HANDLER\r\nfunction api(url, method=\"GET\", body=null){\r\n    document.getElementById(\"status\").innerText = \"Loading...\";\r\n\r\n    return fetch(url, {\r\n        method: method,\r\n        headers: {\"Content-Type\":\"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\"},\r\n        body: body\r\n    })\r\n   .then(async r => {\r\n    let text = await r.text();\r\n\r\n    try {\r\n        return JSON.parse(text);\r\n    } catch(e) {\r\n        document.getElementById(\"output\").innerText = text;\r\n        throw \"Invalid JSON response\";\r\n    }\r\n})\r\n .catch(err=>{\r\n    document.getElementById(\"status\").innerText = \"Error\";\r\n    document.getElementById(\"output\").innerText = err;\r\n    console.error(err);\r\n});\r\n}\r\n\r\n// CORE ACTIONS\r\nfunction ingest(){\r\n\r\n    document.getElementById(\"status\").innerText = \"Loading...\";\r\n\r\n    fetch(\"api/v8/network_add_node.php\", {\r\n        method: \"POST\",\r\n        headers: {\r\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\"\r\n        },\r\n        body: \"network_id=net_case_\" + CASE_ID + \"&content=\" +\r\n              encodeURIComponent(document.getElementById(\"input\").value)\r\n    })\r\n    .then(res => res.text())\r\n    .then(text => {\r\n        try {\r\n            let json = JSON.parse(text);\r\n            document.getElementById(\"output\").innerText =\r\n                JSON.stringify(json, null, 2);\r\n            document.getElementById(\"status\").innerText = \"Done\";\r\n        } catch(e){\r\n            document.getElementById(\"output\").innerText = text;\r\n            document.getElementById(\"status\").innerText = \"Invalid JSON\";\r\n        }\r\n    })\r\n    .catch(err=>{\r\n        document.getElementById(\"status\").innerText = \"Error\";\r\n        document.getElementById(\"output\").innerText = err;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction buildGraph(){\r\n    api(\"api/v8/build_graph.php\", \"POST\",\r\n        new URLSearchParams({case_id: CASE_ID})\r\n    );\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction clusters(){\r\n    api(\"api/v8/cluster_insights.php?case_id=\"+CASE_ID);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction insights(){\r\n    api(\"api/v8/insights_generate.php?case_id=\"+CASE_ID);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction recommendations(){\r\n    api(\"api/v8/recommendations_generate.php?case_id=\"+CASE_ID);\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction generateTasks(){\r\n    api(\"api/v8/generate_tasks.php?case_id=\"+CASE_ID);\r\n}\r\n\r\n// EXECUTION\r\nfunction runWorker(){\r\n    api(\"api/v8/run_worker.php\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n// DEBUG\r\nfunction checkTasks(){\r\n    api(\"api/v8/debug_tasks.php\");\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction checkQueue(){\r\n    api(\"api/v8/debug_queue.php\");\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction loadNetwork(){\r\n    api(\"data/network/net_case_\"+CASE_ID+\".json\");\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n\r\nYou do have the button.\r\n\r\nIt’s just labeled differently:\r\n\r\n<button onclick=\"buildGraph()\">Build Relationships</button>\r\n👉 That IS your “build graph” button\r\n\r\nSo when you said:\