t is NOT being used yet\r\n\r\nYou bypassed real ingest for debugging\r\n\r\n✅ NEXT STEP (IMPORTANT TRANSITION)\r\nWe now move from:\r\n\r\n“force system to work”\r\n\r\nto:\r\n\r\n“restore real intelligence input safely”\r\n\r\n📁 FINAL CLEAN INGEST (FULL FILE REPLACEMENT)\r\nFILE:\r\n/home/carrmulti/www/www/commandcenter/api/v8/network_add_node.php\r\nREPLACE WITH THIS (PRODUCTION VERSION):\r\n<?php\r\n\r\nerror_reporting(0);\r\nini_set(\'display_errors\', 0);\r\n\r\nheader(\'Content-Type: application/json\');\r\n\r\n$case_id = $_POST[\'case_id\'] ?? 1;\r\n$content = $_POST[\'content\'] ?? \'\';\r\n\r\nif (!$content) {\r\n    echo json_encode([\r\n        \"status\" => \"error\",\r\n        \"message\" => \"No content received\"\r\n    ]);\r\n    exit;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nPATH\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$queueFile = \"/home/carrmulti/www/www/commandcenter/data/cases/$case_id/tasks/queue.json\";\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nLOAD\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$queue = [];\r\n\r\nif (file_exists($queueFile)) {\r\n    $queue = json_decode(file_get_contents($queueFile), true);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nADD TASK (REAL INPUT NOW)\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$task = [\r\n    \"type\" => \"add_node\",\r\n    \"content\" => $content,\r\n    \"time\" => date(\"c\")\r\n];\r\n\r\n$queue[] = $task;\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nSAVE\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\nfile_put_contents($queueFile, json_encode($queue, JSON_PRETTY_PRINT));\r\n\r\necho json_encode([\r\n    \"status\" => \"ok\",\r\n    \"queued\" => $task,\r\n    \"queue_count\" => count($queue)\r\n]);\r\n🧪 FINAL TEST (REAL INPUT)\r\n1. In Brain UI, type:\r\nmarket risk detected in Houston retail expansion\r\nClick In