ipeline_adapters.php on line 52\\n\"}\r\n\r\nGood — this is a clean PHP duplication conflict, not a logic issue.\r\n\r\nYou now have the system working well enough that we’ve hit the classic stage:\r\n\r\n“same function exists in two layers”\r\n\r\n🧠 ROOT CAUSE\r\nYou have:\r\n\r\n1. Core engine version\r\n/engine/recommendation_engine.php\r\n→ generateRecommendationsPath()\r\n2. Adapter layer version\r\n/engine/pipeline_adapters.php\r\n→ ALSO defines generateRecommendationsPath()\r\nPHP cannot allow both:\r\n\r\nCannot redeclare function\r\n🚨 WHAT THIS MEANS ARCHITECTURALLY\r\nYou accidentally created two competing ownership layers:\r\n\r\nLayer	Responsibility\r\nengine/	REAL logic\r\npipeline_adapters/	wrapper layer\r\nBut now both define the same function → collision.\r\n\r\n✅ CORRECT FIX (IMPORTANT)\r\nWe must enforce:\r\n\r\nONLY ONE SOURCE OF TRUTH FOR BUSINESS LOGIC\r\n\r\n🧠 RULE YOU MUST LOCK IN\r\nEngine = logic ONLY\r\nAdapters = mapping ONLY (no business logic)\r\n🔧 FIX OPTION (BEST PRACTICE)\r\nWe REMOVE the duplicate function from adapters.\r\n\r\n📁 FILE:\r\n/home/carrmulti/www/www/commandcenter/engine/pipeline_adapters.php\r\n❌ DELETE THIS ENTIRE FUNCTION FROM ADAPTERS:\r\nfunction generateRecommendationsPath($path){\r\n    ...\r\n}\r\n✅ REPLACE WITH THIS (SAFE PASS-THROUGH ONLY):\r\nfunction generateRecommendationsPath($path){\r\n\r\n    require_once __DIR__ . \'/recommendation_engine.php\';\r\n\r\n    // extract case folder safely\r\n    $caseDir = $path;\r\n\r\n    return generateRecommendationsFromPath($caseDir);\r\n}\r\n📁 NOW FIX ENGINE (MINOR NAME ALIGNMENT)\r\nFILE:\r\n/engine/recommendation_engine.php\r\nENSURE FUNCTION NAME IS UNIQUE:\r\nfunction generateRecommendationsFromPath($path){\r\n\r\n    $insightFile = $path . \"insights.json\";\r\n    $recommendFile = $path . \"recommendations.json\";\r\n\r\n    if(!file_exists($insightFile)){\r\n        return;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    $insights = json_decode(file_get_contents($insightFile), true);\r\n\r\n    $recommendations = [];\r\n\r\n    foreach($insights as $insight){\r\n\r\n        if($insight[\'type\'] === \'system_wide_engagement_issue\'){\r\n\r\n            $recommendations[] = [\r\n                \"type\" => \"strategic_action\",\r\n                \"title\" => \"Engagement Systemic Decline Detected\",\r\n                \"action\" => \"Audit content strategy across cases\",\r\n                \"priority\" => \"high\",\r\n                \"created_at\" => date(\"c\")\r\n            ];\r\n        }\r\n\r\n        if($insight[\'type\'] === \'growth_vs_risk_system_pattern\'){\r\n\r\n            $recommendations[] = [\r\n                \"type\" => \"strategic_action\",\r\n                \"title\" => \"Portfolio Risk vs Growth Imbalance\",\r\n                \"action\" => \"Rebalance investment across cases\",\r\n                \"priority\" => \"high\",\r\n                \"created_at\" => date(\"c\")\r\n            ];\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    file_put_contents($recommendFile, json_encode($recommendations, JSON_PRETTY_PRINT));\r\n}\r\n🧠 WHY THIS FIX IS CRITICAL\r\nRight now your system is hitting:\r\n\r\nmultiple layers defining same domain logic\r\nThat is the point where systems start:\r\n\r\nduplicating behavior\r\n\r\nsilently overriding logic\r\n\r\nproducing inconsistent outputs\r\n\r\nWe fix that by enforcing:\r\n\r\nadapters = routing only\r\nengines = intelligence only\r\n\r\n🧪 AFTER FIX EXPECTED RESULT\r\nWorker should return:\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"status\": \"worker_complete\",\r\n  \"processed_total\": 2\r\n}\r\nAND dashboard should finally show:\r\n\r\nPortfolio + case-level strategic recommendations\r\n🚀 WHAT YOU’VE NOW REACHED\r\nYou are at:\r\n\r\n✔ ingestion stable\r\n✔ worker stable\r\n✔ graph stable\r\n✔ cross-case intelligence working\r\n✔ system insight layer active\r\n❌ recommendation layer was duplicated (now fixing)\r\n🧭 NEXT STEP (LAST MAJOR LAYER)\r\nAfter this works, we move to:\r\n\r\n👉 Executive Intelligence Dashboard (FINAL