n.\r\n\r\n🧭 WHAT’S LEFT (REALISTIC COUNT)\r\nThere are 5 meaningful layers left — not 20, not infinite.\r\n\r\nThese fall into two categories:\r\n\r\n🚀 CATEGORY 1: OPERATIONAL INTELLIGENCE (3 layers)\r\nThese turn your system into something that acts, not just thinks.\r\n\r\n1. 🧠 Decision Automation Layer (HIGH PRIORITY)\r\nWhat it does:\r\n\r\nchooses what matters most\r\n\r\nranks risks vs opportunities\r\n\r\noutputs “DO THIS NOW”\r\n\r\nWithout it:\r\n→ system observes\r\n\r\nWith it:\r\n→ system directs action\r\n\r\n2. ⚙️ Task Execution Layer (OPTIONAL but powerful)\r\nWhat it does:\r\n\r\nturns decisions into tasks\r\n\r\nauto-generates workflows\r\n\r\nqueues actions per client/case\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\nClient A → audit content\r\nClient B → scale ads\r\nClient C → risk mitigation\r\n3. 🚨 Alerting / Priority Engine\r\nWhat it does:\r\n\r\nflags urgent conditions\r\n\r\ndetects anomalies\r\n\r\nprevents “slow death” clients\r\n\r\nExample:\r\n\r\n⚠ engagement collapse detected\r\n⚠ risk spike across 3 cases\r\n💼 CATEGORY 2: PRODUCT / BUSINESS LAYER (2 layers)\r\nThese turn it into something you can sell and use daily.\r\n\r\n4. 🧾 Client-Facing System (CRM + Portals)\r\nWhat it does:\r\n\r\nclient dashboards\r\n\r\ncase views\r\n\r\nasset storage\r\n\r\nlogin system\r\n\r\nThis is where LEGAiSEE becomes:\r\n\r\na product, not just a backend system\r\n\r\n5. 📊 Report Generation Engine\r\nWhat it does:\r\n\r\nweekly/monthly reports\r\n\r\nexecutive summaries\r\n\r\nPDF exports\r\n\r\n“Business Archaeology Reports”\r\n\r\nThis is your monetization layer.\r\n\r\n🧠 OPTIONAL (FUTURE, NOT REQUIRED NOW)\r\nOnly after everything above:\r\n\r\n🧠 Machine Learning Layer\r\nembeddings\r\n\r\nsimilarity search\r\n\r\ntrue pattern learning\r\n\r\n👉 Not needed yet\r\n👉 Your current system is already powerful without it\r\n\r\n🤖 Full Autonomy Layer\r\nsystem creates its own goals\r\n\r\nself-optimizes strategies\r\n\r\n👉 Very advanced\r\n👉 Not needed for business value\r\n\r\n🧭 REAL ANSWER\r\nYou have:\r\n8 layers built\r\nYou have left:\r\n5 meaningful layers\r\nOf those, only 2 are critical:\r\n1. Decision Automation Layer\r\n2. Client/Product Layer\r\n🧠 STRATEGIC TRUTH\r\nRight now your system can:\r\n\r\nunderstand businesses better than most marketers\r\n\r\nBut it cannot yet:\r\n\r\ndecide + act + deliver value in a sellable format\r\n\r\nThat’s what the remaining layers fix.\r\n\r\n🚀 RECOMMENDED ORDER (DO THIS)\r\nIf you want momentum (and income potential):\r\n\r\nStep 1:\r\n👉 Decision Automation Layer\r\n\r\nStep 2:\r\n👉 Client Dashboard / Portal\r\n\r\nStep 3:\r\n👉 Report Generator\r\n\r\nEverything else is optional enhancement.\r\n\r\n👉 YOUR NEXT MOVE\r\nSay:\r\n\r\n👉 “build decision automation layer”\r\n\r\nThat’s the point where your system stops being:\r\n\r\nan intelligence engine\r\n\r\nand becomes:\r\n\r\na business operator.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe system keep growing and layers keep getting added as well as data storage locations. i technicall have 2 seperate dashboards. teh shell.php for standars/first, and the Brain.php that is logic. but my actuall visual ui/css for them both is simplistic, and now that client dashboard is on the horizon, i still want things to \"Look\" better. when should i worry about/add ui/css? after all layera are built. because without ui, im not remembering where file sotrae for exports (json) are, plut go back and test things or start ingesting real data i have etc.\r\n\r\nYou’re right to be concerned—but waiting until “all layers are done” to address UI is the wrong move. At your current stage, UI is no longer cosmetic; it’s an operational requirement.\r\n\r\nRight now you have:\r\n\r\ntwo entry points (shell.php vs brain.php)\r\n\r\nmultiple output files across /data/portfolio/ and /data/clients/...\r\n\r\nno centralized visibility\r\n\r\nThat’s exactly when systems become unmanageable.\r\n\r\n🧠 THE CORRECT APPROACH\r\nNot “full UI later”\r\n\r\n👉 You need a Control Layer UI now, and a Polished UI later\r\n\r\n🧭 TWO UI PHASES (DON’T SKIP THIS STRUCTURE)\r\n🔹 PHASE 1 — SYSTEM CONTROL UI (DO THIS NOW)\r\nPurpose:\r\n\r\nmake the system usable, testable, and debuggable\r\n\r\nThis is NOT design-heavy. It’s a command center.\r\n\r\nWhat it must include (minimum viable UI):\r\n1. 🧠 Unified Dashboard (replace split brain/shell confusion)\r\nCreate ONE entry point:\r\n\r\n/commandcenter/index.php\r\nThis becomes your hub.\r\n\r\n2. 📂 File Visibility Panel (CRITICAL FOR YOU)\r\nYou said:\r\n\r\n“I’m not remembering where JSON files are”\r\n\r\nSo fix that structurally.\r\n\r\nUI should show:\r\n\r\n/data/portfolio/\r\n  - executive_dashboard.json\r\n  - predictive_insights.json\r\n  - system_insights.json\r\n\r\n/data/clients/\r\n  - client_X\r\n     - case_Y\r\n        - network.json\r\n        - queue.json\r\n👉 Click → view contents live\r\n\r\n3. ▶ Execution Controls\r\nButtons:\r\n\r\n[ Ingest ]\r\n[ Run Worker ]\r\n[ Refresh Dashboard ]\r\nYou already have pieces—just unify them.\r\n\r\n4. 📊 Output Panels (read-only)\r\nExecutive Dashboard\r\n\r\nPredictive Insights\r\n\r\nSystem Insights\r\n\r\n⚠️ IMPORTANT\r\nThis UI is:\r\n\r\nfunctional\r\n\r\nminimal styling\r\n\r\nhigh visibility\r\n\r\nNOT pretty yet.\r\n\r\n🔹 PHASE 2 — CLIENT / PRODUCT UI (LATER)\r\nThis is when you care about:\r\n\r\nbranding\r\n\r\nanimations\r\n\r\nlayout polish\r\n\r\nclient portals\r\n\r\n🧠 WHY YOU SHOULD NOT WAIT\r\nIf you delay UI:\r\n\r\nYou will hit:\r\n\r\n“Where is that file?”\r\n“Did that engine run?”\r\n“Which case produced this?”\r\nAnd worse:\r\n\r\nfalse debugging problems caused by lack of visibility\r\n🧠 WHAT YOU ACTUALLY NEED (REFRAME)\r\nYou don’t need:\r\n\r\n“a nice UI”\r\n\r\nYou need:\r\n\r\nobservability layer\r\n\r\nThis is a core system component, not a design choice.\r\n\r\n🧭 CLEAN STRUCTURE GOING FORWARD\r\nENTRY POINTS\r\n/commandcenter/index.php     ← MAIN UI (build this now)\r\n/commandcenter/brain.php     ← internal logic view\r\n/commandcenter/shell.php     ← legacy (can phase out later)\r\nDATA VISIBILITY\r\nEverything surfaced via UI from:\r\n\r\n/data/portfolio/\r\n/data/clients/\r\n🧠 PRACTICAL DECISION\r\nDO THIS NOW:\r\nBuild a simple but structured control UI\r\n\r\nDO NOT DO YET:\r\nTailwind redesign\r\n\r\nanimations\r\n\r\nvisual polish\r\n\r\nclient branding\r\n\r\n🚀 WHAT HAPPENS IF YOU DO THIS RIGHT\r\nImmediately:\r\n\r\nyou stop guessing\r\n\r\nyou stop digging through files\r\n\r\nyou can ingest real data confidently\r\n\r\ndebugging becomes trivial\r\n\r\nThen later:\r\n\r\nyou layer design on top of a stable system\r\n\r\n🧭 RECOMMENDED NEXT STEP\r\nSay:\r\n\r\n👉 “build control center UI (full file)”\r\n\r\nAnd I’ll give you:\r\n\r\ncomplete /index.php\r\n\r\nfile browser panel\r\n\r\nexecution buttons\r\n\r\nlive JSON viewers\r\n\r\nbasic clean CSS (not ugly, not overbuilt)\r\n\r\n🧠 FINAL TRUTH\r\nRight now your bottleneck is NOT:\r\n\r\nintelligence\r\n\r\narchitecture\r\n\r\nfeatures\r\n\r\nIt is:\r\n\r\nlack of visibility into your own system\r\n\r\nFix that, and everything else becomes easier.\r\n\r\n\r\nbuild control center UI (full file)\r\n\r\nGood. This is exactly the right move at this stage.\r\n\r\nYou’re not building a “pretty UI” — you’re building a Control Center / Observability Layer so you can actually operate the system.\r\n\r\nBelow is a full, drop-in file with:\r\n\r\nunified dashboard\r\n\r\nfile browser (portfolio + clients)\r\n\r\nworker execution\r\n\r\nJSON viewers\r\n\r\nclean, readable UI (not ugly, not overbuilt)\r\n\r\n📁 FILE LOCATION\r\n/home/carrmulti/www/www/commandcenter/index.php\r\n🧾 FULL FILE REPLACEMENT\r\n<?php\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nLEGAiSEE CONTROL CENTER UI\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$basePath = __DIR__ . \"/data/\";\r\n$portfolioPath = $basePath . \"portfolio/\";\r\n$clientsPath = $basePath . \"clients/\";\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nHELPERS\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\nfunction safeRead($file){\r\n    if(file_exists($file)){\r\n        return json_encode(json_decode(file_get_contents($file), true), JSON_PRETTY_PRINT);\r\n    }\r\n    return \"File not found.\";\r\n}\r\n\r\nfunction listDirRecursive($dir, $base = \"\"){\r\n    $result = [];\r\n\r\n    if(!is_dir($dir)) return $result;\r\n\r\n    foreach(scandir($dir) as $item){\r\n        if($item === \".\" || $item === \"..\") continue;\r\n\r\n        $full = $dir . $item;\r\n\r\n        if(is_dir($full)){\r\n            $result[$item] = listDirRecursive($full . \"/\", $base . $item . \"/\");\r\n        } else {\r\n            $result[] = $base . $item;\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    return $result;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nACTIONS\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$workerOutput = null;\r\n\r\nif(isset($_GET[\'run_worker\'])){\r\n    $workerOutput = shell_exec(\"php \" . __DIR__ . \"/cli/worker.php 2>&1\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nLOAD DATA\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$portfolioFiles = [\r\n    \"executive_dashboard\" => $portfolioPath . \"executive_dashboard.json\",\r\n    \"predictive_insights\" => $portfolioPath . \"predictive_insights.json\",\r\n    \"system_insights\" => $portfolioPath . \"system_insights.json\",\r\n    \"memory_evolution\" => $portfolioPath . \"memory_evolution.json\"\r\n];\r\n\r\n$clientTree = listDirRecursive($clientsPath);\r\n\r\n?>\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n<title>LEGAiSEE Control Center</title>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\nbody {\r\n    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    background: #0f172a;\r\n    color: #e2e8f0;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.header {\r\n    background: #020617;\r\n    padding: 15px;\r\n    font-size: 20px;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.container {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    height: calc(100vh - 60px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.sidebar {\r\n    width: 300px;\r\n    background: #020617;\r\n    border-right: 1px solid #1e293b;\r\n    overflow-y: auto;\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.main {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex-direction: column;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.topbar {\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.content {\r\n    display: flex;\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n    overflow: hidden;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.panel {\r\n    flex: 1;\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n    overflow-y: auto;\r\n    border-right: 1px solid #1e293b;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.panel:last-child {\r\n    border-right: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\nbutton {\r\n    background: #2563eb;\r\n    border: none;\r\n    padding: 8px 12px;\r\n    color: white;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    margin-right: 5px;\r\n}\r\n\r\nbutton:hover {\r\n    background: #1d4ed8;\r\n}\r\n\r\npre {\r\n    background: #020617;\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n    font-size: 12px;\r\n    overflow-x: auto;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.file {\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    padding: 3px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.file:hover {\r\n    background: #1e293b;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.folder {\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin-top: 5px;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction loadFile(path){\r\n    fetch(\"index.php?view_file=\" + encodeURIComponent(path))\r\n    .then(res => res.text())\r\n    .then(data => {\r\n        document.getElementById(\"fileViewer\").innerText = data;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"header\">🧠 LEGAiSEE Control Center</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n\r\n<!-- SIDEBAR -->\r\n<div class=\"sidebar\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"folder\">📂 Portfolio</div>\r\n<?php foreach($portfolioFiles as $name => $file): ?>\r\n<div class=\"file\" onclick=\"loadFile(\'<?php echo $file; ?>\')\">\r\n→ <?php echo $name; ?>\r\n</div>\r\n<?php endforeach; ?>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"folder\">📁 Clients</div>\r\n\r\n<?php\r\nfunction renderTree($tree, $prefix = \"\"){\r\n    foreach($tree as $key => $value){\r\n        if(is_array($value)){\r\n            echo \"<div class=\'folder\'>$prefix$key</div>\";\r\n            renderTree($value, $prefix . \"— \");\r\n        } else {\r\n            echo \"<div class=\'file\' onclick=\\\"loadFile(\'/home/carrmulti/www/www/commandcenter/data/clients/$value\')\\\">$prefix$value</div>\";\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n}\r\nrenderTree($clientTree);\r\n?>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- MAIN -->\r\n<div class=\"main\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"topbar\">\r\n<form method=\"get\" style=\"display:inline;\">\r\n<button name=\"run_worker\" value=\"1\">▶ Run Worker</button>\r\n</form>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"content\">\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL 1 -->\r\n<div class=\"panel\">\r\n<h3>📊 Executive Dashboard</h3>\r\n<pre><?php echo safeRead($portfolioFiles[\'executive_dashboard\']); ?></pre>\r\n\r\n<h3>🔮 Predictive</h3>\r\n<pre><?php echo safeRead($portfolioFiles[\'predictive_insights\']); ?></pre>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL 2 -->\r\n<div class=\"panel\">\r\n<h3>🧠 System Insights</h3>\r\n<pre><?php echo safeRead($portfolioFiles[\'system_insights\']); ?></pre>\r\n\r\n<h3>⏳ Memory Evolution</h3>\r\n<pre><?php echo safeRead($portfolioFiles[\'memory_evolution\']); ?></pre>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<!-- PANEL 3 -->\r\n<div class=\"panel\">\r\n<h3>📄 File Viewer</h3>\r\n<pre id=\"fileViewer\">Click any file on the left</pre>\r\n\r\n<h3>⚙ Worker Output</h3>\r\n<pre><?php echo htmlspecialchars($workerOutput); ?></pre>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<?php\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nFILE VIEW HANDLER (AJAX)\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\nif(isset($_GET[\'view_file\'])){\r\n    $file = $_GET[\'view_file\'];\r\n\r\n    if(file_exists($file)){\r\n        echo file_get_contents($file);\r\n    } else {\r\n        echo \"File not found.\";\r\n    }\r\n    exit;\r\n}\r\n?>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n🧠 WHAT YOU JUST GOT\r\n✔ ONE unified UI (no more brain vs shell confusion)\r\n✔ Portfolio visibility\r\nexecutive_dashboard.json\r\n\r\npredictive_insights.json\r\n\r\nsystem_insights.json\r\n\r\n✔ Client/case file explorer\r\n✔ Click-to-view ANY JSON file\r\n✔ Run worker button\r\n✔ Live worker output\r\n🚀 WHAT TO DO NEXT\r\nUpload file\r\n\r\nOpen:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.legaisee.com/commandcenter/index.php\r\nClick:\r\n\r\nRun Worker\r\n\r\nClick files in sidebar\r\n\r\nWatch system in real time\r\n\r\n🧠 WHAT THIS FIXES IMMEDIATELY\r\n“where are my files?” → solved\r\n\r\n“did it run?” → visible\r\n\r\n“what changed?” → visible\r\n\r\n“is predictive working?” → visible\r\n\r\n🧭 NEXT STEP (WHEN READY)\r\nNow that you can SEE everything, next upgrade is:\r\n\r\n👉 “upgrade control center with case selector + ingest input”\r\n\r\nThat will:\r\n\r\nlet you ingest data from UI\r\n\r\nswitch between clients/cases\r\n\r\nfully operate system without touching files\r\n\r\nYou’ve now crossed from:\r\n\r\nbuilding a system\r\n\r\nto:\r\n\r\noperating a system\r\n\r\n\r\ncan we keep things closer to my black/gold style? = <?php\r\ndeclare(strict_types=1);\r\n\r\n/* CORE BOOT */\r\nrequire_once __DIR__ . \'/kernel/kernel_boot.php\';\r\nrequire_once __DIR__ . \'/kernel/kernel_contract.php\';\r\nrequire_once __DIR__ . \'/kernel/module_contract.php\';\r\n/* UI LAYER */\r\nrequire_once __DIR__ . \'/ui/ui.php\';\r\nrequire_once __DIR__ . \'/ui/layout_engine.php\';\r\n\r\n/*\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n| LEGAiSEE COMMAND CENTER SHELL (UNIFIED UI VERSION)\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n| - Single entry point for all modules\r\n| - Enforces UI shell wrapper\r\n| - Modules return CONTENT ONLY (no full pages)\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n*/\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n/* MODULE REGISTRY */\r\n$registry = require __DIR__ . \'/kernel/module_registry.php\';\r\n\r\nif (!is_array($registry)) {\r\n    http_response_code(500);\r\n    exit(\"REGISTRY FAILED\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* MODULE RESOLUTION */\r\n$moduleKey = $_GET[\'module\'] ?? \'dashboard\';\r\n\r\nif (!isset($registry[$moduleKey])) {\r\n    http_response_code(404);\r\n    exit(\"MODULE NOT REGISTERED: \" . htmlspecialchars($moduleKey));\r\n}\r\n\r\n$moduleFile = __DIR__ . \'/modules/\' . $registry[$moduleKey];\r\n\r\nif (!file_exists($moduleFile)) {\r\n    http_response_code(500);\r\n    exit(\"MODULE FILE MISSING: \" . htmlspecialchars($registry[$moduleKey]));\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* CONTEXT */\r\n$pdo = kernel_db();\r\n$KERNEL_MODULE = $moduleKey;\r\n\r\n\r\n/*\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n| EXECUTE MODULE\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$result = require $moduleFile;\r\n\r\n/*\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n| OUTPUT PIPELINE (FIXED)\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n*/\r\n\r\nif (is_array($result)) {\r\n    $content = ui_render_layout($result);\r\n} else {\r\n    $content = $result;\r\n}\r\n\r\necho ui_shell($content);\r\n\r\nYes—and you should. What you have there is already a real UI architecture (kernel + module system + layout engine). The Control Center I gave you was functional, but it bypassed your system.\r\n\r\nSo instead of replacing your UI, we’re going to integrate the Control Center into your existing black/gold shell system properly.\r\n\r\n🧠 STRATEGY (IMPORTANT)\r\nWe are NOT going to:\r\n\r\ncreate another standalone page ❌\r\n\r\nbreak your module system ❌\r\n\r\nWe ARE going to:\r\n\r\nadd a Control Center module ✔\r\n\r\nreuse your ui_shell() ✔\r\n\r\nkeep your black/gold styling ✔\r\n\r\n🧭 WHERE THIS GOES IN YOUR SYSTEM\r\nYou already have:\r\n\r\n/kernel/\r\n/ui/\r\n/modules/\r\n/shell.php (entry)\r\nWe plug into:\r\n\r\n/modules/control_center.php\r\n📁 1. CREATE MODULE FILE\r\nLOCATION:\r\n/home/carrmulti/www/www/commandcenter/modules/control_center.php\r\nFULL FILE\r\n<?php\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nLEGAiSEE CONTROL CENTER MODULE (BLACK/GOLD SAFE)\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$base = __DIR__ . \'/../data/\';\r\n$portfolio = $base . \'portfolio/\';\r\n$clients = $base . \'clients/\';\r\n\r\nfunction read_json_safe($file){\r\n    if(file_exists($file)){\r\n        return json_encode(json_decode(file_get_contents($file), true), JSON_PRETTY_PRINT);\r\n    }\r\n    return \"File not found.\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nRUN WORKER\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$workerOutput = \'\';\r\n\r\nif(isset($_GET[\'run_worker\'])){\r\n    $workerOutput = shell_exec(\"php \" . __DIR__ . \"/../cli/worker.php 2>&1\");\r\n}\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nPORTFOLIO FILES\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$files = [\r\n    \"Executive Dashboard\" => $portfolio . \"executive_dashboard.json\",\r\n    \"Predictive Insights\" => $portfolio . \"predictive_insights.json\",\r\n    \"System Insights\" => $portfolio . \"system_insights.json\",\r\n    \"Memory Evolution\" => $portfolio . \"memory_evolution.json\"\r\n];\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nRENDER CONTENT (NO HTML SHELL HERE)\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\nob_start();\r\n?>\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n.cc-grid {\r\n    display: grid;\r\n    grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr 1fr;\r\n    height: calc(100vh - 120px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-sidebar {\r\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-panel {\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n    overflow-y: auto;\r\n    border-right: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15);\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-panel:last-child {\r\n    border-right: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-title {\r\n    color: #d4af37;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-file {\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    padding: 4px;\r\n    color: #ccc;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-file:hover {\r\n    background: rgba(212,175,55,0.1);\r\n    color: #fff;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-btn {\r\n    background: #d4af37;\r\n    color: #000;\r\n    border: none;\r\n    padding: 6px 10px;\r\n    cursor: pointer;\r\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-btn:hover {\r\n    background: #f1d77a;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.cc-pre {\r\n    background: #000;\r\n    color: #d4af37;\r\n    padding: 10px;\r\n    font-size: 12px;\r\n    overflow-x: auto;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nfunction loadFile(path){\r\n    fetch(\"?module=control_center&view=\" + encodeURIComponent(path))\r\n    .then(res => res.text())\r\n    .then(data => {\r\n        document.getElementById(\"cc_viewer\").innerText = data;\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n    <form method=\"get\">\r\n        <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"module\" value=\"control_center\">\r\n        <button class=\"cc-btn\" name=\"run_worker\" value=\"1\">▶ Run Worker</button>\r\n    </form>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cc-grid\">\r\n\r\n    <!-- SIDEBAR -->\r\n    <div class=\"cc-sidebar\">\r\n        <div class=\"cc-title\">Portfolio</div>\r\n\r\n        <?php foreach($files as $label => $path): ?>\r\n            <div class=\"cc-file\" onclick=\"loadFile(\'<?php echo $path; ?>\')\">\r\n                → <?php echo $label; ?>\r\n            </div>\r\n        <?php endforeach; ?>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL 1 -->\r\n    <div class=\"cc-panel\">\r\n        <div class=\"cc-title\">Executive Dashboard</div>\r\n        <pre class=\"cc-pre\"><?php echo read_json_safe($files[\"Executive Dashboard\"]); ?></pre>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"cc-title\">Predictive</div>\r\n        <pre class=\"cc-pre\"><?php echo read_json_safe($files[\"Predictive Insights\"]); ?></pre>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <!-- PANEL 2 -->\r\n    <div class=\"cc-panel\">\r\n        <div class=\"cc-title\">System Insights</div>\r\n        <pre class=\"cc-pre\"><?php echo read_json_safe($files[\"System Insights\"]); ?></pre>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"cc-title\">Memory Evolution</div>\r\n        <pre class=\"cc-pre\"><?php echo read_json_safe($files[\"Memory Evolution\"]); ?></pre>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"cc-title\">File Viewer</div>\r\n        <pre id=\"cc_viewer\" class=\"cc-pre\">Click a file</pre>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"cc-title\">Worker Output</div>\r\n        <pre class=\"cc-pre\"><?php echo htmlspecialchars($workerOutput); ?></pre>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<?php\r\n\r\n$content = ob_get_clean();\r\n\r\n/*\r\n================================================\r\nAJAX FILE VIEW HANDLER\r\n================================================\r\n*/\r\n\r\nif(isset($_GET[\'view\'])){\r\n    $file = $_GET[\'view\'];\r\n\r\n    if(file_exists($file)){\r\n        echo file_get_contents($file);\r\n    } else {\r\n        echo \"File not found.\";\r\n    }\r\n    exit;\r\n}\r\n\r\nreturn [\r\n    \"title\" => \"Control Center\",\r\n    \"content\" => $content\r\n];\r\n📁 2. REGISTER MODULE\r\nFILE:\r\n/kernel/module_registry.php\r\nADD THIS LINE:\r\n\'control_center\' => \'control_center.php\',\r\n🧠 HOW TO ACCESS\r\nhttps://www.legaisee.com/commandcenter/shell.php?module=control_center\r\n🎯 WHAT YOU JUST DID\r\n✔ Kept your architecture intact\r\n✔ Used your UI shell (black/gold stays consistent)\r\n✔ Added system visibility\r\n✔ No duplicate dashboards anymore\r\n🧠 IMPORTANT SHIFT\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nUI = separate tools\r\n\r\nNow:\r\n\r\nUI = modular system inside your kernel\r\n\r\n🚀 NEXT STEP (HIGH VALUE)\r\nNow that this is integrated cleanly:\r\n\r\n👉 “add ingest input + case selector to control_center”\r\n\r\nThat turns this into:\r\n\r\nfull operator console\r\n\r\nno file editing required\r\n\r\nreal client workflow begins\r\n\r\nYou’re now building a cohesive system, not stacking pieces.\r\n\r\n\r\nsince we\'re doing this can we do it in a version coser ti what the final will be? the, layout, colors, styles, cards, text, other elements of my webpage mo