.\r\n\r\nI’m going to be precise so you don’t keep chasing ghosts.\r\n\r\n1. Why Brain / Files are not showing\r\nRoot cause chain:\r\n❌ Error 1\r\nCannot redeclare function ui_shell()\r\npreviously declared in ui/ui.php\r\nand again in modules/files_module.php\r\nMeaning:\r\nYou accidentally defined core UI functions inside a module.\r\n\r\n👉 Modules must NEVER define:\r\n\r\nui_shell()\r\n\r\nui_card()\r\n\r\nlayout engine functions\r\n\r\nkernel functions\r\n\r\nThose belong ONLY in:\r\n\r\n/ui/ui.php\r\n/ui/layout_engine.php\r\n❌ Error 2\r\nCall to undefined function ui_card()\r\nMeaning:\r\nYour module is calling a function that does not exist globally OR was never loaded due to earlier fatal error stopping execution\r\n\r\nSo:\r\n\r\nUI load is partially broken\r\n\r\nexecution halts before full shell render\r\n\r\n2. Why everything is breaking now\r\nYou are currently mixing 3 layers:\r\n\r\nA) Kernel Layer\r\ndatabase\r\n\r\nengines\r\n\r\ncross-case memory\r\n\r\nB) UI Layer\r\nshell.php\r\n\r\nui.php\r\n\r\nlayout_engine.php\r\n\r\nC) Modules\r\nbrain_module.php\r\n\r\nfiles_module.php\r\n\r\ncases_module.php\r\n\r\n❌ Current violation\r\nModules are acting like mini-apps instead of “content providers”\r\n\r\n3. Correct Architecture Rule (CRITICAL)\r\nMODULE RULE:\r\nA module MUST ONLY:\r\nreturn arrays OR HTML fragments\r\n\r\nNOT define global functions\r\n\r\nNOT include UI system\r\n\r\nNOT reinitialize kernel\r\n\r\n4. FIX: files_module.php (clean baseline)\r\nReplace your broken module with this pattern:\r\n\r\n✔️ files_module.php (FULL SAFE VERSION)\r\n<?php\r\n\r\n/*\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n| FILES MODULE\r\n| CONTENT ONLY - NO SYSTEM FUNCTIONS\r\n|------------------------------------------------------------\r\n*/\r\n\r\n$pdo = $pdo ?? null; // injected from shell\r\n\r\n$filesPath = __DIR__ . \'/../data/files\';\r\n\r\n$files = [];\r\n\r\nif (is_dir($filesPath)) {\r\n    foreach (scandir($filesPath) as $