ve one problem; you have two separate system breaks happening at once:\r\n\r\n🧠 PROBLEM 1 — DB PATH BREAK (CRITICAL, SIMPLE FIX)\r\nError:\r\nrequire_once(db.php): Failed to open stream\r\nMeaning:\r\nYour files are still trying to load:\r\n\r\nrequire_once \"db.php\";\r\nBut your DB file is actually here:\r\n\r\n/commandcenter/data/db.php\r\nSo PHP literally cannot find it.\r\n\r\n🧱 FIX 1 — FULL FILE STANDARDIZATION (NO PATCHING)\r\nWe fix this properly by enforcing ONE correct include pattern everywhere.\r\n\r\n📁 FULL REPLACEMENT: ingest.php\r\n<?php\r\nrequire_once __DIR__ . \"/bootstrap.php\";\r\n\r\nif ($_SERVER[\'REQUEST_METHOD\'] === \'POST\') {\r\n\r\n    $stmt = $pdo->prepare(\"\r\n        INSERT INTO page (title, project, platform, type)\r\n        VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?)\r\n    \");\r\n\r\n    $stmt->execute([\r\n        $_POST[\'title\'],\r\n        $_POST[\'project\'],\r\n        $_POST[\'platform\'],\r\n        $_POST[\'type\']\r\n    ]);\r\n\r\n    $pageId = $pdo->lastInsertId();\r\n\r\n    $stmt = $pdo->prepare(\"\r\n        INSERT INTO page_content (page_id, content)\r\n        VALUES (?, ?)\r\n    \");\r\n\r\n    $stmt->execute([\r\n        $pageId,\r\n        $_POST[\'content\']\r\n    ]);\r\n\r\n    header(\"Location: ingest.php\");\r\n    exit;\r\n}\r\n?>\r\n\r\n<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<?php include \"layout.php\"; ?>\r\n\r\n<h2>Ingest</h2>\r\n\r\n<form method=\"POST\">\r\n    <input name=\"title\" placeholder=\"Title\"><br>\r\n    <input name=\"project\" placeholder=\"Project\"><br>\r\n    <input name=\"platform\" placeholder=\"Platform\"><br>\r\n    <input name=\"type\" placeholder=\"Type\"><br>\r\n    <textarea name=\"content\"></textarea><br>\r\n    <button type=\"submit\">Save</button>\r\n</form>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n🧠 PROBLEM 2 — DATABASE LOGIN FAILURE (REAL ISSUE)\r\nError:\r\nAccess denied for user \'root\'@\'localhost\' (using password: NO)\r\nMeaning:\r\nYour system is doing:\r\n\r\nuser = root\r\n\r\npassword = 