 future system:\r\n\r\n4 AI pipelines running sequentially\r\n\r\ningestion of historical marketing artifacts\r\n\r\nstructured extraction into database\r\n\r\nclustering + scoring + summarization\r\n\r\nIf your frontend architecture is inconsistent:\r\n\r\nyour AI layer will inherit chaos\r\n\r\nIf your frontend architecture is strict:\r\n\r\nyour AI layer becomes plug-and-play modular intelligence\r\n\r\n🧱 FINAL FLOW (THIS IS YOUR TRUE SYSTEM)\r\nUSER → index.php (or module page)\r\n     → sets metadata + contentFile\r\n     → shell.php\r\n         → loads module\r\n         → captures output buffer\r\n         → injects into UI shell\r\n         → renders full interface\r\n🚨 CRITICAL RULES (LOCK THESE NOW)\r\nRULE 1 — ONLY ONE RENDERER EXISTS\r\nshell.php is the ONLY file that outputs full HTML\r\nRULE 2 — NO PAGE OUTPUT EVER\r\nPages never echo, print, or render UI.\r\n\r\nRULE 3 — MODULES ARE DUMB VIEWS\r\nThey do not know:\r\n\r\nrouting\r\n\r\nshell\r\n\r\nsystem state\r\n\r\nRULE 4 — NO DUAL SYSTEMS\r\nWe eliminate:\r\n\r\n$content injection model ❌\r\n\r\nhybrid rendering ❌\r\n\r\nlayout.php usage ❌ (eventually deprecated entirely)\r\n\r\n🧠 WHAT THIS SOLVES LONG TERM\r\nThis eliminates:\r\n\r\nUI drift\r\n\r\n“some pages look better than others”\r\n\r\nbroken forms\r\n\r\nmissing layouts\r\n\r\ndual menu systems\r\n\r\ninconsistent CSS inheritance\r\n\r\n🔥 IMPORTANT STRATEGIC NOTE (THIS CONNECTS TO YOUR BUSINESS IDEA)\r\nYour upcoming system:\r\n\r\nBusiness Archaeology AI (multi-agent extraction system)\r\n\r\nwill depend on:\r\n\r\nstructured ingestion pipelines\r\n\r\npredictable content schemas\r\n\r\nmodular retrieval layers\r\n\r\nThis architecture becomes:\r\n\r\nthe UI + orchestration layer for your AI intelligence system\r\n\r\nSo this decision is not just web structure — it is platform foundation design.\r\n\r\n🚀 NEXT STEP (ONLY WHEN YOU SAY GO)\r\nNow that architecture is locked, next phase is NOT UI tweaking yet.\r\n\r\nNext real step is:\r\n\r\