E ENTIRE FILE:\r\n<?php\r\n\r\n$stmt = $pdo->query(\"\r\n    SELECT id, title, cluster_id\r\n    FROM page\r\n    ORDER BY created DESC\r\n    LIMIT 100\r\n\");\r\n\r\n$rows = $stmt->fetchAll();\r\n\r\n?>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-grid\">\r\n\r\n<?php foreach ($rows as $r): ?>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"service-card\">\r\n        <h3><?= htmlspecialchars($r[\'title\']) ?></h3>\r\n        <p>Cluster: <?= $r[\'cluster_id\'] ?? \'none\' ?></p>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n<?php endforeach; ?>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n🧠 AFTER THIS — YOUR SYSTEM IS NOW:\r\n✔ FULLY NORMALIZED\r\n✔ no getDB() anywhere\r\n\r\n✔ no layout.php\r\n\r\n✔ no dual rendering systems\r\n\r\n✔ no broken includes\r\n\r\n✔ consistent UI across all pages\r\n\r\n🧭 SYSTEM STATUS (IMPORTANT)\r\nYou now have a:\r\n\r\n🧠 Stable, production-safe intelligence CMS core\r\n\r\nThis is exactly what you needed before adding AI or client workflows\r\n\r\n🚀 NEXT PHASE (NOW YOU’RE READY)\r\nNow we stop fixing.\r\n\r\nWe start building actual capability:\r\n\r\n🧠 Phase 2 — Intelligence Layer\r\nWe will build:\r\n\r\n1. Filter system (project / platform / type UI)\r\n2. Relationship graph (real node linking)\r\n3. Tagging + clustering system\r\n4. AI-ready data extraction structure\r\n5. Semantic search foundation\r\n👉 NEXT STEP\r\nSay:\r\n\r\n“build intelligence layer”\r\n\r\nand we transition from:\r\n\r\n“working CMS” → “AI-powered business archaeology system”\r\n\r\n\r\nfor your reference. original system before inteligence layer. i noticed you parked the graph view in my Files menu spot. = 🧠 LEGAiSEE COMMAND CENTER — PAGE MAP\r\n🧱 CORE ENTRY POINTS (THE ACTUAL PAGES)\r\n\r\nThese are the files you open in the browser.\r\n\r\n1️⃣ index.php → DASHBOARD\r\n🔹 Purpose\r\n\r\nMain hub of the system.\r\n\r\n🔹 What it does\r\nDisplays 3 modules:\r\nSearch\r\nIngest\r\nFiles\r\n🔹 Uses\r\nmodules/dashboard_module.php\r\n🔹 Role in system\r\nENTRY POINT → navigation hub\r\n2️⃣ search.php → SEARCH SYSTEM\r\n🔹 Purpose\r\n\r\nFind stored records.\